{"날짜": "2026-09-11", "시험지명": "초당고_고1_2025_2_중간", "루프ID": "20260911-CL-G1S-c930628d", "문항": {"1": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">&lt;보기&gt;에서 집합인 것만을 있는 대로 고른 것은?</p><p><div class=\"box\"><div class=\"bl\">ㄱ. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>과 가까운 수의 모임</div><div class=\"bl\">ㄴ. 대한민국 광역시의 모임</div><div class=\"bl\">ㄷ. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></math>보다 큰 자연수의 모임</div></div></p><p></p><div class=\"pcs c3\"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span>ㄱ</span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span>ㄴ</span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span>ㄱ, ㄷ</span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span>ㄴ, ㄷ</span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span>ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ</span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 1번 · 집합과 원소, 집합의 표현"}, "8": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">자연수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></math>에 대하여</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007B;</mo><mi>x</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">&#x0007C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">&#x0007D;</mo></mrow></mrow></math>는 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></math>의 배수인 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow></math> 이하의 자연수<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" /><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">&#x0007D;</mo></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>라고 할 때, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x02229;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0222A;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>의 값은?</p><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 8번 · 배수·약수와 방정식의 해집합"}, "15": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">방정식 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>이 나타내는 도형이 그림과 같을 때, 방정식 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>이 나타내는 도형은?</p><p></p><div class=\"fig\"><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></div><div class=\"pcs c2 pic\"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 15번 · 방정식 f(x, y)=0이 나타내는 도형의 이동"}, "18": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">좌표평면에서 두 직선 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></math>에 모두 접하고 점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">&#x00028;</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></mrow></math>을 지나는 서로 다른 두 원의 중심을 각각 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></math>라 할 때, 선분 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></math>의 길이는?</p><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>22</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>26</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 18번 · x축과 y축에 동시에 접하는 원의 방정식"}, "20": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>을 지나고 점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>에서의 거리가 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></math>인 두 직선을 각각 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></math>이라 하자. 두 직선 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></math>에 동시에 접하고 반지름의 길이가 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>인 원 중에서 중심이 제<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>사분면 위에 있는 원의 중심의 좌표를 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>라고 할 때, 상수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>에 대하여 순서쌍 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math> 는? (단, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0003E;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math>)</p><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 20번 · 점과 직선 사이의 거리"}}}